Regression test for rexglue-sdk#459 (initialize host FPSCR state before XHostThread callbacks). The fix itself is the XHostThread::Execute hunk of 0104-host-fp-exception-mask.patch; this adds the upstream xthread_tests case, which runs a host callback on a thread with an unmasked MXCSR and checks that every exception mask is set.

